Super high detailed mid poly game and render ready model of the Porshe 911 Carrera. Highest quality guarantee. Best choise for the VR and realtime projects.

  - Ready for realtime scenes or game engines (Marmoset, Unity, Unreal, Lumberyard, Cryengine etc);

  - The model is ready for rigging and animation;

  - Subdivision ready model;

  - Files format included: .Blend (Original), .Max(2012), .Mb(2020), .C4D(2020), .3Ds, .abc, .dae, .fbx (All-Purpose), .obj (All-Purpose), .stl, ,ply, .x3d;

  - The model origin has zero transform position at the center of the scene;

  - The model consists of 4 objects and 4 materials (Basis, Glass, Interior, Wheels); Every part can be separated or joined;

  - All parts of the model have clear names;

  - Each material includes clear UV, textures and PBR maps;

  - No plugins used or needed for this model;

  - Includes 4096x4096 .png textures;

  - Textures and maps included: Diffuse (BaseColor), Normal, Roughness, Metalness, Emissive, AO;

  - Easy color changing system. Use basecolor shader and mix any color there to get the Porshe color you need.

  - The Emissive color can be easily changed or turned off;

  - Original file is .blend; It can be opened in any Blender software (2.9 and older versions included). Made in Blender 2.79b;

  - The file is ready for rendering in Cycles and Blender, all textures have been linked and packed into .blend files;

Thanks for choosing this product.

